            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Torrid 0.2.0</h2>
<p>Torrid now feels more at home on the Mac.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Notifications: get a notification when a download finishes or fails. Click it to show the file in Finder. Several tasks finishing at once are combined into one notification. You can turn this off in Settings › General.</li>
  <li>Dock icon: while downloading, the flame turns blue and burns back to orange from the bottom up — its height is the overall progress. The badge now counts downloads that finished while you were away, and clears when you come back to Torrid.</li>
  <li>Finder: files that are still downloading show a progress bar in Finder.</li>
  <li>External disks: ejecting a disk pauses the downloads saved on it, so the disk can be ejected safely. They continue on their own when the disk is connected again — even if Torrid was restarted in between.</li>
  <li>Error messages now follow the app language; they no longer appear in Chinese in the English interface.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Torrid 0.2.0（简体中文）</h2>
<p>Torrid 更像一个地道的 Mac App 了。</p>
<ul>
  <li>通知：下载完成或失败时发系统通知，点一下在访达中显示文件；几个任务同时完成会合并成一条。可以在「设置 › 通用」里关掉。</li>
  <li>Dock 图标：下载时火焰变成蓝色，橙色从下往上烧回来，烧到多高就是总进度。角标改为「你不在时完成的下载数」，回到 Torrid 就清零。</li>
  <li>访达：还在下载的文件会在访达里显示进度条。</li>
  <li>外置磁盘：推出磁盘时，存在上面的下载会自动暂停，磁盘可以安全推出；磁盘接回来后自动继续，中途重启过 Torrid 也一样。</li>
  <li>错误提示现在跟随界面语言，英文界面里不再出现中文报错。</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
